. firmware sources (one ESP-IDF component)
CMakeLists.txt component file: source list, embedded assets, dependencies
idf_component.yml managed components: esp_tinyusb, libpng, led_strip
main.c start-up order, main console loop
bat.c battery voltage (ADC, divider /3)
bat.h battery API
ble_serial.c BLE console (Nordic UART Service, NimBLE)
ble_serial.h BLE console API
btn.c buttons 1..10 (tact / touch): SHORT DOUBLE DOWN UP REPEAT, BTN command
btn.h buttons API and BTN command
cmd.c command parser and registry, HELP
cmd.h command API
dns.c captive-portal DNS server (web mode)
dns.h DNS server API
font.c font table and lookup
font.h font API
font_mono.c monospace fonts (generated by tools/mkfont.py)
font_serif.c serif fonts (generated by tools/mkfont.py)
gfx.c drawing commands (lines, boxes, circles ...)
gfx.h drawing API
i2c.c I2C bus (IMU)
i2c.h I2C API
img.c PNG images from SD (IMG), screenshots (SCR SHOT)
img.h image API
imu.c QMI8658A IMU: readings, detectors, orientation, sleep, REC, DEBUG
imu.h IMU API and IMU command
lcd.c ST7789 LCD: frame buffers, rotation, view flip, SCR command
lcd.h LCD API
led.c RGB LED (WS2812 on GPIO38)
led.h LED API
log.c log routing to UART / USB, dbgf(), LOG command
log.h log API
nv.c NV settings (NVS flash): NV SET/GET/RESET/EXPORT/IMPORT
nv.h NV keys and API
reset.c reset when no UI works: SD:/sys/reset.nvram at boot, RESET! screen actions
reset.h reset API and behaviour
scr.h script interpreter API
scr_host.h hooks the interpreter needs from its host
scr_int.h interpreter internals
scr_load.c script loader: files, INSERT, blocks, functions, VARS, .CONST
scr_eval.c script values, expressions, $variable substitution
scr_exec.c script execution: statements, events, errors, debugger
script.c scripts in the firmware: task, RUN/STOP/... commands, events, system scripts
script.h scripts API and commands
script_cfg.h script language limits
scrtr.c screen transitions (fade, push, wipe, dissolve)
scrtr.h transitions API
sd.c SD card mount / check, file lists
sd.h SD card API
ser.c serial ports UART0 and USB-Serial/JTAG
ser.h serial API
sys.c INFO MEM WAIT REBOOT PRINT DEBUG FLOG FCAT FDIR FSTAT FDELETE, boot counter, timestamps
sys.h system commands API
telnet.c telnet console server
telnet.h telnet API
text.c text boxes (TBOX, ECHO ...), text argument rules
text.h text boxes API
ui.c user interfaces (BLE TELNET WEB UART USB), events, Wait screen logic
ui.h user interface API
uiscr.c connection screens (boot, Wait details, splash)
uiscr.h connection screens API
usbdisk.c FILES: SD card as a USB drive
usbdisk.h USB disk API
web.c web console: HTTP server, WebSocket, files from /www
web.h web console API
webpath.c URL to SD path mapping (safe)
webpath.h URL mapping API
wifi_ap.c Wi-Fi access point
wifi_ap.h Wi-Fi AP API
DESCRIPT.ION file descriptions for this folder
